  {
    "zh": "找不到开发者选项时，到关于手机连续点按系统版本号。系统或厂商未提供无线调试时，填写端口无法启用它。\n\n通常让地址与端口留空即可自动发现。配对端口来自 6 位码弹窗，连接端口来自无线调试主页面，两者不能互换。\n\n首次准备依赖可能较久；配对码失效时请重新获取。自动读码需要屏幕操作权限，手动输入无需此权限。",
    "en": "If Developer options is missing, tap the build number repeatedly in About phone. Entering a port cannot enable Wireless debugging if your Android version or manufacturer does not provide it.\n\nUsually, leave address and port blank for automatic discovery. The pairing port comes from the 6-digit-code dialog; the connection port comes from the main Wireless debugging page. They are not interchangeable.\n\nInitial dependency preparation may take time. Get a fresh code if yours expires. Auto-read requires screen-control permission; manual entry does not.",
    "uiFormat": false,
    "files": [
      "app/src/main/java/com/deepseekharness/app/ui/AdbPairActivity.java"
    ]
  },
