    "zh": "会停止 Web 并中断正在执行的任务，完整备份并校验配置、会话和本地插件，再重建环境并恢复数据。\n\n备份失败不切换环境，后续失败回切旧环境；安全备份和旧环境会保留并占用额外空间。额外安装的系统软件留在旧环境中。",
    "en": "Stop the Web service and interrupt running tasks. Back up and verify settings, conversations and local plugins, then rebuild the environment and restore data.\n\nIf backup fails, the environment is unchanged. If a later step fails, the old environment is restored. The safety backup and old environment use additional space. Extra system software remains in the old environment.",
